    <item>
      <title>What Is Time</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/blog/what-is-time/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/blog/what-is-time/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;As Saint Augustine once reflected, &amp;ldquo;What then is time? If no one asks me, I know; if I wish to explain it, I do not.&amp;rdquo;&#xA;Perhaps we can only trace its elusive shadow in the drifting dreams of the past.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
